ut one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn a large company, manager Emily mistakenly placed an important document about impending layoffs in the shredding room. Janitor Bob, while cleaning the shredding room, threw it into the shredder. At the same time, senior executive Susan was aware of the document's importance, but chose not to inform Bob due to a power struggle with Emily, hoping to see Emily blamed for the mistake. When Emily discovered the missing document and learned that the layoff news had leaked, she became very panicked and started an investigation. Susan told Bob that Emily had accidentally misplaced the document herself, implying that the office conflict triggered the incident and that it was not his fault.\n\n[Question]\nWhat kind of emotion does Bob feel after realizing that he may have shredded Emily's document by mistake?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Bob possibly feels satisfied because he completes the task of cleaning the office, helping to clear the scrap paper.\nB. Bob possibly feels angry because he is misled to shred the wrong document.\nC. Bob possibly feels confused because he is not sure if he really shreds Emily's document.\nD. Bob possibly feels panicked and guilty because he may unintentionally cause a significant loss to the company.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52a95c2ddb05a7fe2e6b5","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452117461,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:55:17","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":nu